### Analytics Feature API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/api/analytics

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/analytics
@token = your-auth-token-here
@alias = your-alias
@startDate = 2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z
@endDate = 2024-12-31T23:59:59.000Z

### 1. Get URL Analytics (comprehensive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Get Analytics Overview (summary stats)
GET {{baseUrl}}/overview?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Get Browser Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/browsers?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Get Device Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/devices?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 5. Get Clicks Over Time (default groupBy: day)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clicks-over-time?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 6. Get Clicks Over Time grouped by hour
GET {{baseUrl}}/clicks-over-time?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&groupBy=hour
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 7. Get Clicks Over Time grouped by week
GET {{baseUrl}}/clicks-over-time?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&groupBy=week
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 8. Get Clicks Over Time grouped by month
GET {{baseUrl}}/clicks-over-time?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&groupBy=month
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 9. Get Geographic Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/geography?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 10. Get Referer Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/referers?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 11. Get Hourly Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/hourly?alias={{alias}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 12. Get Analytics for last 7 days
GET {{baseUrl}}/overview?alias={{alias}}&startDate=2024-01-01T00:00:00.000Z&endDate=2024-01-07T23:59:59.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 13. Get Analytics with only alias (no date range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/overview?alias={{alias}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 14. Test without authorization (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/overview?alias={{alias}}

###

### 15. Test with invalid alias (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/overview?alias=invalid-alias-that-is-too-long
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
